flowchart LR
  M[Incoming report<br/>manual or approved channel]
  D[Pending intake draft<br/>preserve source, ID, sender and time]
  H{Coordinator review}
  X[Correct / reject / request clarification]
  P[Publish approved response]
  B[Apply explicit branch tag<br/>for example KLB]
  T{Create linked assignment?}
  A[Assign team and due/status]
  L[Append actor-attributed timeline event]
  R[Read-only response register]
  Q[Filter and summarize<br/>branch, team, date]
  W[Preview and export Word report]

  M --> D --> H
  H -->|needs correction| X --> H
  H -->|approve| P --> B --> T
  T -->|yes| A --> L
  T -->|no| L
  P --> R
  A --> R
  L --> Q
  R --> Q --> W
